{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act9d0_level_act9d0_04_end",
  "groupId": "act9d0",
  "stageId": "act9d0_06",
  "title": "遠遁",
  "storyCode": "DM-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "dfa8ebd050fcc591ed766b45b94eda0282d9fb39577930fe8f9273f6362b27f6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "巴別塔發生了什麼——但凡當時和特蕾西婭殿下有所聯繫的薩卡茲，都會有這個疑問。\nW無疑看清了真相，但在漫長的旅途中，她隻字不談。\n我沒有問，伊內絲也沒有，但我覺得她會比我更接近真相。\n不知不覺之間，我已經是走在最後的那個人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "......我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "是的，不會有問題，各支隊之間保持聯絡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "......遵命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "......呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "各位，看來我們要在這裡駐紮一陣子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "先遣隊觀察到了天災雲，沒有天災信使在這附近，以防萬一，我們只能盡可能遠離天災。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "無論如何，不能冒這個風險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "......天災嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "很少親眼見識到在荒野肆虐的天災。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "不過卡茲戴爾和源石打交道的歷史也有很久了，倒是不至於那麼慌亂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "......W呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "待在她自己的小隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "......你要去找她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "我......不確定。W變了很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "你以為W會因為失去特蕾西婭而性情大變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "但她現在冷靜得不像是W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "不過先前在戰場上找到她的時候，她確實還是那副玩世不恭的嘴臉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "應該說比起過去有過之而無不及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "真難得，你竟然能察覺到這種細微的違和感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "......別諷刺我。如果W安靜下來，那根本不算“細微”的違和感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "W她——啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "山的那一邊，雲在彙聚，氣壓的變化非常劇烈......那就是天災雲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "......這個規模，可能駐紮在這裡也是不安全的，通知所有支隊，按原路線後撤五十公里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "去找W，動作快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "......別命令我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "W給我的感覺，和那個很像喔，現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "——啊啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "W！你在幹什麼——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "這裡——風好大！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "還能幹什麼，欣賞天災啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "你瘋了嗎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "你說什麼？聽——不——清——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "嘖，忘了你本來就是個瘋子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "別讓你手下的薩卡茲陪你一起送命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "我已經讓他們跟著赫德雷撤離了啦，我又不蠢——啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "W！你給我小心點！嘁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "你才是別過來喔，摔下去你可受不了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "你就受得了嗎？你要是不想死就給我回來——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "......你們兩個搞什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "你問她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "是她非要礙著我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "幸虧W的隊伍沒有損失，否則在與整合運動的領袖合流之前，我們就要先上一趟軍事法庭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "都先回去休息吧，等待通知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "在天災中作戰又怎麼樣？你害怕礦石病嗎？害怕風暴嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "我只是單純的不想死於非命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "我們都該提前適應一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "這會是種有趣的體驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "伊內絲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "別這樣，我沒生氣，又不是小孩子吵架要你來回哄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "W她......把隊伍安置得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "很難得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "很難得......我都不知道她是更瘋了，還是......她......哎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "text": "她是個屁的天災雲，她就是個天災。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "text": "（粗口......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "哼哼哼~哼哼~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你心情好像很不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "當然了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "有些消息，就是要離開卡茲戴爾那個破地方才能打聽到啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這也不是你把見面地點定在天災雲下面的理由吧......你是要我的命嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "欸，別這麼說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "你知道當一個瘋子有什麼好處嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不太想知道，但我其實已經知道了，畢竟我聽你的，頭兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "這就對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "好處就是，你做的事情越不合邏輯，就越不會遭人質疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "羅德島號的的確確離開了卡茲戴爾，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "準確來說，是沒有情報表明這麼大一艘艦船被殿......被特雷西斯納入囊中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "那就夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "text": "嗯，還是有一些線索的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "隊伍中的生面孔越來越多，我反倒安心起來，對自己離開了卡茲戴爾有了實感。\n同行者裡，有敵人，也有戰友，總是這樣反覆無常。\n雇傭兵是不會在意過去的，因為我們就是這樣一個異常容易放下生死的種族。\n又或者是因為那場戰爭結束得太快，我們立刻就投身了下一個戰場，未曾品嘗過哪怕一秒的和平。\n......或許這種希望也只是某種毒藥，我們始終需要鬥爭和衝突來緩和其平衡。\nW就是最好的例子，她早已甘之如飴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "歡迎你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "遠道而來的戰士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "戰爭從來不是什麼可以逃避的事物。\n這我知道，當然知道，只是到那一刻，我終於意識到。\n戰爭早已彌漫在這片大地的每個角落，從每個意志相互獨立的生命誕生開始。\n而我們再度深陷其中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
